ht:96px;top:934px;z-index:15;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#4F5E43;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"soft-prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"edge-prism\"><span class=\"p1\"></span><span class=\"p2\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div><div class=\"r3\"></div><div class=\"r4\"></div><div class=\"r5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">BRAND POSITIONING / 溪木咖啡</div>\n\n  <header class=\"head\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\"><i></i>02 / 品牌定位</div>\n    <h1>品牌定位：日常、友好、易理解</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">溪木咖啡是<b>虚构的社区咖啡品牌</b>，定位为日常、友好、易理解。</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"keywords\">\n    <div class=\"kw\">\n      <div class=\"kw-top\"><span class=\"kw-no\">01</span><span class=\"kw-tag\">定位关键词</span></div>\n      <div class=\"kw-word\">日常</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kw\">\n      <div class=\"kw-top\"><span class=\"kw-no\">02</span><span class=\"kw-tag\">定位关键词</span></div>\n      <div class=\"kw-word\">友好</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kw\">\n      <div class=\"kw-top\"><span class=\"kw-no\">03</span><span class=\"kw-tag\">定位关键词</span></div>\n      <div class=\"kw-word\">易理解</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <div class=\"quote-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">品牌口号</div>\n      <div class=\"slogan\">把日常慢慢喝好</div>\n      <div class=\"quote-mark\">“</div>\n      <div class=\"quote-foot\">口号表述以材料原文为准 · <em>材料为虚构测评内容</em></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"facts\">\n      <div class=\"facts-row\">\n        <div class=\"fact\">\n          <div class=\"fact-num\">11<span>家</span></div>\n          <div class=\"fact-label\">试点门店</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fact-sep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"fact\">\n          <div class=\"fact-num\">5<span>周</span></div>\n          <div class=\"fact-label\">传播周期</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fact-note\">数字仅供测评</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"foot-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"foot-note\">材料中所有数字仅供测评，不作对外承诺</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">2 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"Let me create page 2 with the same visual style: cream background, forest green accents, gold, slate blue, serif display headings, thin rules, register circle, right edge prism, dots, page number.\n\nContent: 品牌定位：日常、友好、易理解\n- 溪木咖啡是虚构的社区咖啡品牌\n- 定位为日常、友好、易理解\n- 品牌口号为“把日常慢慢喝好”\n- 试点门店11家，传播周期5周\n\nLayout: title top-left, three keyword cards (日常/友好/易理解), a quote block with the slogan, and stat chips (11家 / 5周).\n\nLet me design:\n- Top rule, left rail with rotated label \"BRAND POSITIONING\".\n- Header: eyebrow \"02 / 品牌定位\", title \"品牌定位：日常、友好、易理解\" (serif, 104px maybe fits ~ 14 chars; 104px * 14 = 1456px, fits within 1760).\n- Sub: 溪木咖啡是虚构的社区咖啡品牌。\n- Three cards for 日常 / 友好 / 易理解 with short descriptors... but must not invent facts. I can use the positions as labels only, with brief non-factual descriptors? Better keep descriptors minimal, derived from doc: \"日常\"、\"友好\"、\"易理解\" — descriptors could risk fabrication. I can use small labels like \"定位关键词\" and just the word. Maybe add brief explanatory line that is clearly paraphrase-free... Safer: cards just show keyword + small note \"定位关键词 01/02/03\". Hmm, that's a bit thin but honest.\n\nAlternatively make cards: 品牌性质 / 定位 / 口号 sections. But outline says bullets. Let me do:\n\nLeft column (large): title + subtitle + slogan quote block with gold quote marks: \"把日常慢慢喝好\".\nRight column: three stacked keyword cards (日常, 友好, 易理解) — vertical list with numbers.\nBottom: stat strip: 试点门店 11 家 | 传播周期 5 周 | 触点类型 3 类? No, 3类 is page 4; but it's in doc. Keep to page points: 11家 and 5周. Add note \"数字仅供测评\".\n\nLayout plan (1920×1080, margins 96):\n- top-rule at top 48, left 96, width 1760.\n- page-no left 28 top 61? Actually page number requirement: right bottom \"2 / 6\". I'll put bottom-right \"2 / 6\" and also keep left rail style.\n\nLet me build:\n\nHeader area y=100..300:\n- eyebrow: \"02 — 品牌定位\" letterspaced, muted, y=112.\n- title: \"品牌定位：日常、友好、易理解\" at y=150, font-size 92px serif, weight 500. Width: 14 chars? \"品牌定位：日常、友好、易理解\" = 14 glyphs. At 92px → ~1288px. Fits.\n- lead paragraph at y~280: \"溪木咖啡是虚构的社区咖啡品牌。\" 26px muted.\n\nMiddle: two columns.\nLeft (x=96, width ~800):\n- slogan card: surface bg with thin border, containing label \"品牌口号\" and big serif italic-ish quote \"把日常慢慢喝好\" 64px.\nRight (x=960? width 800): three keyword rows with numbers 01 02 03, hairline separators, each row with keyword 40px + tag \"定位关键词\".\n\nBottom strip: stat blocks: \"11 家 试点门店\"、\"5 周 传播周期\" plus note \"所有数字仅供测评\".\n\nLet's place:\n- Top rule y=48.\n- Title block y=120.\n- Main content y=430..820.\n- Bottom strip y=860..960 with top hairline.\n\nLet me be careful with vertical space: 1080 height.\n\nHeader:\neyebrow top:112\ntitle top:150 (line-height 1.06, ~100px height) → ends ~260\nlead top:290 → ends ~330\n\nThen main content from y=380 to 830.\n\nLeft panel: x=96, width=760, top=380, height=440. Card with border 1px rgba, background rgba(255,255,255,.35)? Reference uses surface #F3F0E7. Use background: rgba(243,240,231,.72) with 1px border rgba(27,38,32,.14).\n\nInside: label \"品牌口号\" small letterspaced at top; quote marks gold; slogan \"把日常慢慢喝好\" serif 68px; bottom note \"统一使用，不改编\" — hmm that's from outline page3 (\"统一使用品牌口号\"). The doc says 品牌口号为\"把日常慢慢喝好\". I'd add a note \"口号：把日常慢慢喝好（原文表述）\"? Keep simple: small caption \"材料原文表述\" — that's meta, ok.\n\nRight panel: x=896 (96+760+40=